{"run_id": "20260802T160849-hepkg", "qid": "gen-known-175b73d0", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses report the systematic uncertainty Jet flavor tagging calibration uncertainty?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The graph records 51 distinct analyses that report the systematic uncertainty related to jet flavor tagging calibration. These analyses collectively report 128 facts and 130 assertions involving this systematic uncertainty.\n\nTo provide more context, here are some of the specific systematic uncertainties included in this count:\n- Jet flavor tagging calibration uncertainty\n- Jet flavor evaluation uncertainty\n- Flavour-tagging ($b$/$c$/light-jet) efficiency calibration uncertainty\n- b jet tagging efficiency and light-flavor misidentification rate uncertainty\n- $b$-jet identification algorithm calibration uncertainty\n- b-tagging efficiency uncertainty for light-flavor jets\n- b-jet identification (flavour tagging) uncertainty\n- Heavy-flavor tagging efficiency scale factor uncertainty\n- b jet tagging efficiency uncertainty\n- b jet tagging efficiency uncertainty (another instance)\n- Flavour tagging uncertainty\n- H->bb jet (DeepAK8) tagging efficiency uncertainty\n- Jet uncertainties: JVT, jet energy scale (JES), jet energy resolution (JER), flavour tagging\n- track-jet b-tagging uncertainty\n- High-$p_{T}$ extrapolation uncertainty for $b$/$c$-jet tagging efficiencies\n- Flavour-tagging (b-tagging) uncertainty\n- Non-prompt-lepton BDT / lepton isolation BDT calibration uncertainty\n- b-tagging efficiency uncertainty for c-jets\n- b-tagging efficiency uncertainty for b-jets\n- Jet-vertex-tagger efficiency uncertainty\n- Jet flavour (b-tagging) discriminant shape nuisance parameters\n- Jet mass resolution (JMR) uncertainty\n- Jet and E_T^miss experimental uncertainty\n\nIf you need more detailed information on any specific analysis or systematic uncertainty, please let me know.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Jet flavor tagging calibration uncertainty", "kind": "systematic_uncertainty"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.237}, {"round": 2, "tool": "count", "args": {"predicate": "result_has_systematic", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 1, "error": null, "seconds": 0.004}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:syst:b_tagging_efficiency", "hepkg:syst:hcal_inefficiency", "hepkg:syst:jer", "hepkg:syst:jes", "hepkg:syst:jet_calibration_group", "hepkg:syst:jet_energy_resolution", "hepkg:syst:jet_energy_scale", "hepkg:systematic:b-jet-efficiency", "hepkg:systematic:b-jet-identification", "hepkg:systematic:b-tagging", "hepkg:systematic:b-tagging-efficiency", "hepkg:systematic:b-tagging-veto-efficiency-uncertainty", "hepkg:systematic:b_c_high_pt_extrapolation", "hepkg:systematic:b_jet_msv_shape_correction", "hepkg:systematic:b_jet_tagging", "hepkg:systematic:b_tagging", "hepkg:systematic:b_tagging_efficiency", "hepkg:systematic:bb_jet_tagging", "hepkg:systematic:btag-b", "hepkg:systematic:btag-c", "hepkg:systematic:btag-calibration", "hepkg:systematic:btag-category-normalization", "hepkg:systematic:btag-deepjet", 