{"run_id": "20260802T160849-hepkg", "qid": "gen-known-1922befb", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the object Jet?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The following analyses define the object \"Jet\":\n\n1. **$CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H\\rightarrow\\gamma\\gamma$ with the ATLAS Detector** (Paper ID: 2004.04545)\n2. **Constraints on Higgs boson properties using $WW^{*}(→ eνμν)jj$ production in 36.1 fb⁻¹ of $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV $pp$ collisions with the ATLAS detector** (Paper ID: 2109.13808)\n3. **Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector** (Paper ID: 2111.08340)\n4. **Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV** (Paper ID: 2504.13081)\n5. **Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV** (Paper ID: 2510.07527)\n6. **Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV** (Paper ID: 2602.18611)\n7. **Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state** (Paper ID: 2205.05120)\n8. **Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV** (Paper ID: 2402.08486)\n9. **Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV** (Paper ID: 2605.14245)\n\nThese analyses cover a range of topics including Higgs boson interactions, constraints on Higgs properties, and differential cross section measurements. Each of these papers defines the object \"Jet\" in various contexts, such as in the final state, regions, and other aspects of the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.04363", "2010.14293", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2405.18661", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Jet", "kind": "detector_object"}, "rows": 51, "error": null, "seconds": 0.043}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_defines_object", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 152, "error": null, "seconds": 0.003}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:109c1212671935ca00101cdf", "hepkg:final_state:3l", "hepkg:final_state:4l", "hepkg:result:c77dc93c4243dc6282c1e450", "hepkg:result:f30a5987a892a17a8cd2f437", "hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:52d0213216b446bc782fa4dc", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:d4ebc4413bef90f04142edbe"]}, "rows": 14, "error": null, "seconds": 0.006}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:object:H-jet", "hepkg:object:VR-Z-VV-njet", "hepkg:object:ak4-jet", "hepkg:object:ak4_b_jet", "hepkg:object:ak4_jet", "hepkg:object:ak8-jet", "hepkg:objec