{"run_id": "20260802T160849-hepkg", "qid": "gen-known-65d50552", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "List the papers that estimate the background Non-$VH$ Higgs boson background (ggF, VBF, $t\\bar{t}H$).", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The following papers estimate the background Non-$VH$ Higgs boson background (ggF, VBF, $t\\bar{t}H$):\n\n1. **$CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H\\rightarrow\\gamma\\gamma$ with the ATLAS Detector** (Paper ID: 2004.04545)\n2. **Measurement of the inclusive and differential ${\\mathup{{{W}}}}{\\mathup{{{Z}}}}$ production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in ${\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$** (Paper ID: 2110.11231)\n3. **Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector** (Paper ID: 2111.08340)\n4. **Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$** (Paper ID: 2202.08676)\n5. **Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state** (Paper ID: 2205.05120)\n6. **Evidence for the charge asymmetry in $pp\\rightarrow t\\bar{t}$ production at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector** (Paper ID: 2208.12095)\n7. **Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations** (Paper ID: 2312.04450)\n8. **CMS ttbar+Z0 (ttZ) associated production cross section measurement** (Paper ID: 2405.18661)\n9. **HH->bb gamgam analysis result** (Paper ID: 2510.07527)\n10. **HH->bbWW, WW->4q all-hadronic analysis result** (Paper ID: 2510.07527)\n11. **HH->multilepton analysis result** (Paper ID: 2510.07527)\n12. **HH->bbZZ(4l) analysis result** (Paper ID: 2510.07527)\n13. **HH->WWgamgam analysis result** (Paper ID: 2510.07527)\n14. **Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$** (Paper ID: 2602.18611)\n15. **Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons and the top quark** (Paper ID: 2604.21670)\n16. **Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 $\\mathup{{{b}}}$ final state** (", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.04545", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2008.05928", "2010.14293", "2012.03799", "2012.08600", "2102.01444", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2304.08962", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2404.06204", "2405.18661", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2506.13565", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Non-VH Higgs boson background (ggF, VBF, ttH)", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 52, "error": null, "seconds": 0.251}, {"round": 2, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 80, "error": null, "seconds": 0.004}, {"round": 3, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:result:109c1212671935ca00101cdf", "hepkg:result:ttz_measurement", "hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8", "hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556", "hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044", "hepkg:result:3ceb5926f4ce82b73c00210b", "hepkg:result:4a162a98ce57274854442b0f", "hepkg:result:755b77b523c64332ab0fea19", "hepkg:result:wwgam