{"run_id": "20260802T160849-hepkg", "qid": "gen-known-767aee88", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses measured Inclusive HH production signal strength (mu = sigma_HH / sigma_HH^SM)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The graph records 19 distinct analyses that measured the Inclusive HH production signal strength (μ = σ_HH / σ_HH^SM) or related observables. Here are some of the specific results and the papers that measured them:\n\n1. **$CP$ Properties of Higgs Boson Interactions with Top Quarks in the $t\\bar{t}H$ and $tH$ Processes Using $H\\rightarrow\\gamma\\gamma$ with the ATLAS Detector**\n   - Paper: [ATLAS Collaboration]\n\n2. **CMS combined Higgs boson pair production cross section limit**\n   - Paper: [CMS Collaboration]\n\n3. **Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$**\n   - Paper: [ATLAS and CMS Collaborations]\n\n4. **Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$**\n   - Paper: [CMS Collaboration]\n\n5. **Combined $μ_{H\\to c\\bar{c}}$ upper limit (ttH+VH combination)**\n   - Paper: [ATLAS Collaboration]\n\n6. **Combined Run 2 + Run 3 HH->4b result**\n   - Paper: [ATLAS Collaboration]\n\n7. **Combined Run 3 resolved+merged HH->4b result**\n   - Paper: [ATLAS Collaboration]\n\n8. **Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H\\rightarrow b\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector**\n   - Paper: [ATLAS Collaboration]\n\n9. **Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions using the final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}$**\n   - Paper: [CMS Collaboration]\n\n10. **Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons**\n    - Paper: [ATLAS and CMS Collaborations]\n\nThese analyses cover a range of final states and production modes, contributing to the overall understanding of the Higgs boson properties and interactions. If you need more detailed information on any specific analysis, please let me know.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2004.04545", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2012.01581", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2308.02285", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2405.18661", "2504.13081", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044", "2605.14245"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Inclusive HH production signal strength (mu = sigma_HH / sigma_HH^SM)"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.22}, {"round": 2, "tool": "count", "args": {"predicate": "result_measures_observable", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 1, "error": null, "seconds": 0.002}, {"round": 3, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_measures_observable", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 77, "error": null, "seconds": 0.008}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:benchmark:sm-higgs-inclusive-xsec", "hepkg:observable:hh_incl_signal_strength", "hepkg:observable:hh_vbf_signal_strength", "hepkg:observable:higgs_mass_profiled", "hepkg:observable:higgs_signal_strength_inclusive", "hepkg:observable:higgs_signal_strength_per_decay", "hepkg:observable:higgs_signal_strength_per_prod_decay", "hepkg:observable:higgs_signal_strength_per_production", "hepkg:observable:mu-HH", "hepkg:observable:mu-ZH", "hepkg:observable:mu-ZZ", "hepkg:observable:mu-ggHH", "hepkg:observable:mu-ggh-tth", "hepkg:observable:mu-h-inclusive", "hepkg:observable:mu-inclusive-hgg", "hepkg:observable:mu-qqHH", "hepkg:observable:mu-ttbar-inclusive", "hepkg:observable:mu-vbf-vh", "hepkg:observable:mu-z-fiducial-validation", "hepkg:observ