{"run_id": "20260802T160849-hepkg", "qid": "gen-known-8e7a11b6", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses report the systematic uncertainty Full set of Section 7 systematic uncertainties included as nuisance parameters?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The graph records 53 analyses that report the systematic uncertainty \"Full set of Section 7 systematic uncertainties included as nuisance parameters\" or similar systematic uncertainties. Here are some of the specific analyses:\n\n1. **Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\)** (Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:5ee7b252fd18b7e1733f5e78`)\n2. **Combination of searches for nonresonant Higgs boson pair production in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\)** (Assertion IDs: `hepkg:assertion:fde0a5c10500f35dd91a2bf9`, `hepkg:assertion:04690403b1ead8407cbffabd`, `hepkg:assertion:9d01a6de97ee1af0ded55b67`)\n3. **Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\)** (Assertion IDs: `hepkg:assertion:851127875edd49e217429691`, `hepkg:assertion:bb334c6d2a33c3ec9a1d93f1`, `hepkg:assertion:6d57b16d956fad4dbd48b1a1`)\n4. **Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\(H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b}\\) decays in the ATLAS detector** (Assertion IDs: `hepkg:assertion:c24e1fcf9c7053c880840872`, `hepkg:assertion:0bf5d6cac841b9f3f46c1a10`, `hepkg:assertion:25182bce8838e02890a984cd`, `hepkg:assertion:ffeaf25742b7071033480286`)\n5. **Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state** (Assertion IDs: `hepkg:assertion:f352e3be6c8a34f287727f8c`, `hepkg:assertion:a85f30d82620776859bc1f12`)\n6. **Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from \\(pp\\) collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\,\\text{TeV}\\)** (Assertion ID: `hepkg:assertion:4add6ba640abb4c93ad799bf`)\n7. **Effective field theory interpretation of ATLAS measurements involving the Higgs boson, electroweak bosons and the top quark** (Assertion IDs: `hepkg:assertion:a94c6914aa2cb7d818ac31fe`, `hepkg:assertion:c4a88ffb9b12b736584f1bd1`, `hepkg:assertion:b8cdad73e073a8c523d7", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.01678", "2004.14060", "2006.05880", "2007.02873", "2009.04363", "2009.14537", "2010.14293", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2012.03799", "2103.04956", "2103.06956", "2106.01676", "2106.14246", "2107.12553", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2112.00895", "2112.03161", "2201.11585", "2202.08676", "2205.05120", "2206.09466", "2207.00348", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2211.08028", "2302.05225", "2303.15340", "2307.01094", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2401.07090", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2407.10549", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2506.13565", "2508.13900", "2509.22535", "2510.07527", "2511.11853", "2602.18611", "2604.21670", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Full set of Section 7 systematic uncertainties included as nuisance parameters", "kind": "systematic_uncertainty"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.114}, {"round": 2, "tool": "count", "args": {"predicate": "result_has_systematic", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 1, "error": null, "seconds": 0.009}, {"round": 3, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_has_systematic", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 150, "error": null, "seconds": 0.007}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:syst:integrated_luminosity", "hepkg:syst:other_systematic_group", "hepkg:syst:pdf", "hepkg:syst:pileup_reweighting", "hepkg:syst: