{"run_id": "20260802T160849-hepkg", "qid": "gen-known-a8cad1bb", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses define the region Control region CR^Z_VV for multi-boson background normalisation (3ℓ selection)?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The following analyses define the region **Control region CR^Z_VV for multi-boson background normalisation (3ℓ selection)**:\\n\\n- **2001.06899**: Measurement of the associated production of a $\\\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$   TeV\\n- **2007.02873**: Measurements of $WH$ and $ZH$ production in the $H\\\\rightarrow b\\\\bar{b}$ decay channel in $pp$ collisions at $13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\kern-1.00006ptV}$ with the ATLAS detector\\n- **2009.14537**: Observation and measurement of forward proton scattering in association with lepton pairs produced via the photon fusion mechanism at ATLAS\\n- **2103.04956**: Measurements of production cross sections of the Higgs boson in the four-lepton final state in proton-proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\\n- **2110.11231**: Measurement of the inclusive and differential ${\\\\mathup{{{W}}}}{\\\\mathup{{{Z}}}}$ production cross sections, polarization angles, and triple gauge couplings in ${\\\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\\n- **2111.08340**: Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H\\\\rightarrow b\\\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector\\n- **2202.08676**: Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$\\n- **2304.08962**: Observation of an excess of di-charmonium events in the four-muon final state with the ATLAS 